# U.S.S. Defiant: its entering trigger may target its controller's own permanents. Bot1 suits up Memnite with Rancor on
# turn 1, then destroys its own Rancor (an enchantment) with the Defiant on turn 5 - and Rancor returns to hand when put
# into the graveyard from the battlefield, which is where the Expect finds it. Memnite survives it.

